==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 15 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Since Kories are present, the level cap will play a bigger role than usual. Damage can't be avoided because of the waves, so the lower the magnification, the easier it will be for your units to take knockbacks and not land hits, in addition to needing to land more in the first place. For this reason, tackling this stage earlier than expected is highly discouraged, unless one owns good anti-wave units.

